YARA-X is a re-incarnation of YARA, a pattern matching tool designed
with malware researchers in mind. This new incarnation intends to be
faster, safer and more user-friendly than its predecessor. The ultimate
goal of YARA-X is replacing YARA as the default pattern matching tool
for malware researchers.

With YARA-X you can create descriptions of malware families (or whatever
you want to describe) based on textual or binary patterns. Each
description (a.k.a. rule) consists of a set of patterns and a boolean
expression which determine its logic.
